  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Welcome to this 4-bedroom, 210m² (approx) floor area, family home in the heart of Milford. Set on a perfectly flat section, you’re just a short, level stroll to top-rated schools, Milford Village & Beach, North Shore Hospital, medical facilities, Smales Farm Business Park, and transport links. Everything you need is right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFeatures You’ll Love:\r\n- This recently renovated home features 4 bedrooms plus 1 study/office upstairs can be also used as 5th kid's bedroom, 3 bathrooms (including 1 master ensuite),  providing restful retreats for the whole family.\r\n- Enjoy seamless indoor-outdoor flow from your spacious living area to a fully fenced private deck & garden, perfect for summer BBQs & tranquil morning coffees, relaxation and enjoyment.\r\n- Whip up delicious meals with ease using the quality appliances, including a dishwasher and stove, all bathed in natural light.\r\n- Double internal access garage plus 2 off-street parking for your camper or guests—convenience at its best!\r\n\r\nThe location is superb, just a leisurely 5-minute stroll away from the vibrant Milford village, Milford beach and the shops, restaurants and cafes, here you can live the quintessential Kiwi coastal lifestyle. A flat walk along the shoreline or road will also have you in Takapuna with all its amenities, and of course Lake Pupuke, parks and reserves are also close by. School zones are exemplary and varied, from Milford School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, and both Westlake Girls and Boys High Schools. Close to the Smales Farm bus station, make your travel more convenient.\r\n\r\nImagine family gatherings on the sun-drenched deck, effortless commutes, and weekends exploring vibrant local cafes and shops—all from your own sanctuary in one of Auckland’s most desirable neighbourhoods. Don’t miss your chance to secure this exceptional home. Call now!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
